; resource medallions (docs/ART.md 6.1): an 11x11 soot disc whose rim (# slot) gives the class
; (food o, strategic 6, luxury y, mana P), with a 7x7 glyph inside; both centred on tile (25, 25).
; Glyphs are flat: at most 4 colours, no light except the one core pixel of GOLD, the Fruit of
; Yggdrasil and the mana runes. Mana runes follow the sphere table of 11.5 (colour = family, shape =
; sphere). The category glyphs (_food, _strategic, _luxury, _mana) are the fallbacks.

= res/_disc 11x11 5,5
: note the seal; # is the class rim (food o, strategic 6, luxury y, mana P), set by the mapping `rim`
...#####...
..#11111#..
.#1111111#.
#111111111#
#111111111#
#111111111#
#111111111#
#111111111#
.#1111111#.
..#11111#..
...#####...

